---
// Services section with 4-column grid and lime icons
---

<section id="services" class="py-10 md:py-24 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] text-primary uppercase text-center font-semibold m-0">
        One-On-One consulting
      </h2>
      
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-2">
        Let's face it - there are millions of digital marketers out there. You can pay for consultations from most of them for a fraction of the cost of what we charge at Lime Media (yes we are very blunt).
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        But there is one thing that sets us apart from all of them. We have actual real-life business experience.
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        For 14 years we have spent our own money on all our different platforms. We have launched more than 114 businesses online, spent MILLIONS in online advertising and we are still running and managing many successful online businesses internally.
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        Where most digital agencies spend other companies’ budgets and report back on fancy metrics like engagement, clicks and brand reach; we focus on one thing only - getting an amazing ROI from our campaigns.
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
         We have real boots-on-the-ground experience, we have spent millions online to discover what works and what doesn’t and it took us 14 years to build up the knowledge we have today.
      </p>      

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
         So if you want to learn from the best, then enquire below to see if we can help you. Once you enquire, we will put you through our screening process to see if we are able to help you or not. We are extremely selective over our clients when it comes to consulting since we have very limited openings left. Our rate is $2,500 per hour so if you'd like to apply, then get in touch below.
      </p>   
      
      <div class="">

        <h3 class="text-[26px] font-bold text-primary text-center mt-15">GET IN TOUCH NOW</h3>
        
        <div class="bg-white w-full md:w-[60%] mx-auto px-6 py-6 mt-8 shadow-md">
          <form 
            id="consulting-form"
            class="
              w-full
              flex flex-col gap-4 
              text-left 
              mt-8
            "
          >
            <input 
              type="text" 
              placeholder="Name" 
              name="name"
              class="
                p-4 
                border border-[#cccccc] outline-none focus:border-primary
                bg-white 
                text-[16px] font-normal
                transition-colors 
                placeholder:text-gray-400
              " 
              required 
            />

            <input 
              type="text" 
              placeholder="Company" 
              name="company"
              class="
                p-4 
                border border-[#cccccc] outline-none focus:border-primary
                bg-white 
                text-[16px] font-normal
                transition-colors 
                placeholder:text-gray-400
              " 
              required 
            />

            <input 
              type="tel" 
              placeholder="Telephone" 
              name="telephone"
              class="
                p-4 
                border border-[#cccccc] outline-none focus:border-primary
                bg-white 
                text-[16px] font-normal
                transition-colors 
                placeholder:text-gray-400
              " 
              required 
            />

            <input 
              type="email" 
              placeholder="Email Address" 
              name="email"
              class="
                p-4 
                border border-[#cccccc] outline-none focus:border-primary
                bg-white 
                text-[16px] font-normal
                transition-colors 
                placeholder:text-gray-400
              " 
              required 
            />

            <input 
              type="text" 
              placeholder="Budget" 
              name="budget"
              class="
                p-4 
                border border-[#cccccc] outline-none focus:border-primary
                bg-white 
                text-[16px] font-normal
                transition-colors 
                placeholder:text-gray-400
              " 
              required 
            />

            <textarea 
              placeholder="Message" 
              name="message"
              rows="6" 
              class="
                p-4 
                border border-[#cccccc] outline-none focus:border-primary
                bg-white 
                text-[16px] font-normal
                transition-colors 
                placeholder:text-gray-400
                resize-none
              " 
              required></textarea>

            <button 
              type="submit" 
              name="consulting-form"
              class="
                bg-primary 
                text-white 
                py-4 
                uppercase 
                text-[18px] font-semibold 
                border-none 
                cursor-pointer 
                hover:bg-primary-hover 
                transition-colors
              "
            >
              SUBMIT
            </button>

            <!-- Success message -->
            <div
              id="consulting-success"
              class="hidden p-4 bg-green-100 border border-green-300 text-green-700 text-center"
              role="alert"
            >
              Thank you! Your message has been sent successfully.
            </div>      

            <!-- Error message -->
            <div
              id="consulting-error"
              class="hidden p-4 bg-red-100 border border-red-300 text-red-700 text-center"
              role="alert"
            >
              Something went wrong. Please try again.
            </div>      
          </form>

          <script is:inline>
            const form = document.querySelector("#consulting-form");
            const successMessage = document.querySelector("#consulting-success");
            const errorMessage = document.querySelector("#consulting-error");

            form?.addEventListener("submit", async (event) => {
              event.preventDefault();

              const button = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');

              // Hide previous messages
              successMessage?.classList.add("hidden");
              errorMessage?.classList.add("hidden");

              if (button) {
                button.disabled = true;
                button.textContent = "SENDING...";
              }

              try {
                const formData = new FormData(form);

                // Change this to your webhook URL
                const response = await fetch("https://n8n.limemedia.co.za/webhook/limeagency", { // Notify on Slack (via n8n)
                  method: "POST", 
                  headers: { 
                    "Content-Type": "application/json", 
                  }, 
                  body: JSON.stringify({ 
                    name: formData.get("name"), 
                    company: formData.get("company"), 
                    telephone: formData.get("telephone"), 
                    email: formData.get("email"), 
                    budget: formData.get("budget"), 
                    message: formData.get("message"), 
                  }), 
                });

                // For now, simulate a successful submission
                await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 1000));

                if (!response.ok) { 
                  throw new Error(`Webhook returned ${response.status}`); 
                }

                // Webhook succeeded
                form.reset();
                successMessage?.classList.remove("hidden");
              } catch (error) {
                console.error("Form submission failed:", error);
               
                // Webhook failed
                errorMessage?.classList.remove("hidden");
              } finally { 
                if (button) { 
                  button.disabled = false; 
                  button.textContent = "SUBMIT"; 
                } 
              }
            });
          </script>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

